MODEL reachability
    FACT (a edge b)
    FACT (b edge c)
    GROUP closure
        RULE direct
        WHEN
            ($x edge $y)
        THEN
            ADD ($x reachable $y)
        END
        RULE transitive
        WHEN
            ($x reachable $y)
            ($y edge $z)
        THEN
            ADD ($x reachable $z)
        END
    END_GROUP
    CONSTRAINT reaches_c
        KIND FACTS
        REQUIRE (a reachable c)
        FORBID (c reachable a)
    END_CONSTRAINT
    QUERY closure SOLVE
    END_QUERY
END_MODEL
